    col
      text "name=\"example\" can be added to multiple <details> so only one can be open at a time."
      text Accordion 1
      text Flamingos are known for their bright pink feathers and distinctive long necks. These birds are social creatures that live in large groups, and a group of flamingos is called a flamboyance. They can often be seen standing on one leg, which helps them conserve body heat.
      text Accordion 2
      link "Copy code" /docs/accordion
      text "<details name=\"example\" open> <summary>Accordion 1</summary> <p>...</p> </details> <hr /> <details name=\"example\"> <summary>Accordion 2</summary> <ul> <li>...</li> <li>...</li> </ul> </details>"
      h2 Button variants#
      text "role=\"button\" can be used to turn <summary> into a button."
      button Button primary
      link "Copy code" /docs/accordion
      text "<details> <summary role=\"button\">Owls</summary> <p>...</p> </details>"
      text Like regular buttons, they come with , , and  (Not available in the ).
      text .secondary
      text .contrast
      text .outline
      link "class-less version" /docs/classless
      button Secondary primary
      button Contrast primary
      button "Primary outline"
      button "Secondary outline"
      button "Contrast outline"
      link "Copy code" /docs/accordion
      text "<!-- Secondary --> <details> <summary role=\"button\" class=\"secondary\">Secondary</summary> <p>...</p> </details> <!-- Contrast --> <details> <summary role=\"button\" class=\"contrast\">Contrast</summary> <p>...</p> </details> <!-- Primary outline --> <details> <summary role=\"button\" class=\"outline\">Primary outline</summary> <p>...</p> </details> <!-- Secondary outline --> <details> <summary role=\"button\" class=\"outline secondary\">Secondary outline</summary> <p>...</p> </details> <!-- Contrast outline --> <details> <summary role=\"button\" class=\"outline contrast\">Contrast outline</summary> <p>...</p> </details>"
      link "Edit this page on GitHub" https://github.com/picocss/picocss.com/blob/main/app/routes/docs.accordion.jsx
